  "notes": "Production configuration for Raspberry Pi 4 Model B (UnitaPresidioMacchina001). All 6 sensors configured: 2×ISM330DHCX (0x6A, 0x6B), 2×MAX6675 (SPI CE0, CE1), 2×SCT013+ADS1115 (0x48 CH0, CH1)."
